<title>USA: U.S. coffee imports - Commerce.</title>
<headline>U.S. coffee imports - Commerce.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Commerce Department</p>
<p>report of unroasted, roasted and soluble coffee imports.</p>
<p> (Tonnes):    May97    Apr97    May96</p>
<p> Unroasted  104,281  107,549   86,631</p>
<p> Roasted	1,796    2,597    1,906</p>
<p> Soluble	1,556    1,854    2,571</p>
<p>Soluble</p>
<p> from Brazil    473	530    1,214</p>
<p>Note - Coffees include decaffeinated and nondecaffeinated. Soluble includes instant and nonflavored, plus extracts, essences and concentrates.</p>
</text>
